OL,3,GNEWSAPaddling pools created for ducks
OL,4,Aas pond dries up
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers have been filling up
OL,7,Fmakeshift paddling pools to help ducks
OL,8,Fstay hydrated after their historic pond
OL,9,Fcompletely dried up.
OL,11,FThe 17th Century pond in Biddestone,
OL,12,FWiltshire, was originally used for
OL,13,Fcattle from nearby farms, and locals
OL,14,Fbelieve this is the first time it has
OL,15,Fever lost all its water.
OL,17,FAs well as providing the paddling
OL,18,Fpools, villagers are also attempting to
OL,19,Fpreserve the ancient landmark by
OL,20,Fdredging silt from it while water
OL,21,Flevels are low.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
