OL,3,GNEWSAPaddling pools created for ducks
OL,4,Aas pond dries up
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal farmer David Taylor, who came up
OL,7,Fwith the "cunning plan" to keep the
OL,8,Fducks at the pond, said he had never
OL,9,Fseen it so dry. Parish Councillor Nick
OL,10,FPike said residents were missing one of
OL,11,Fthe "main attractions" of the area.
